                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I don't generally like card games but this is an interesting mix of starcraft, magic and other RTS elements.\n\nThe game is simple enough where you can pick up fairly quickly but gets complex (in a good way) pretty soon. There's a bit of a meta going on so it'll be interesting to see where development goes with this.\n\nPros: \nCool artwork\nIn depth game play\nReally cheap with early access\nNot pay to win. I don't see any mechanics that you have to buy cards but you just unlock them.\n\nCons: \nInstructions could be a bit better \n\nProtip:\nTurn on fast settings under the options when you start. Animations will go quicker.",
